{"id":"torrey:anakim-the","source":"torrey","name":"Anakim, The","slug":"anakim-the","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Descent of — Nu 13:22; Jos 15:13.","refs":[["Num",13,22,13,22],["Josh",15,13,15,13]]},{"text":"The sons of Anak. — Nu 13:33.","refs":[["Num",13,33,13,33]]},{"text":"The sons of the Anakim. — De 1:28.","refs":[["Deut",1,28,1,28]]},{"text":"The children of the Anakims. — De 9:2.","refs":[["Deut",9,2,9,2]]},{"text":"Divided into three tribes — Jos 15:14.","refs":[["Josh",15,14,15,14]]},{"text":"Inhabited the mountains of Judah — Jos 11:21.","refs":[["Josh",11,21,11,21]]},{"text":"Hebron, chief city of — Jos 14:15; 21:11.","refs":[["Josh",14,15,14,15],["Josh",21,11,21,11]]},{"text":"Of gigantic strength and stature — De 2:10,11,21.","refs":[["Deut",2,10,2,10],["Deut",2,11,2,11],["Deut",2,21,2,21]]},{"text":"Israel terrified by — Nu 14:1; 13:33.","refs":[["Num",14,1,14,1],["Num",13,33,13,33]]},{"text":"Hebron a possession of, given to Caleb for his faithfulness — Jos 14:6-14.","refs":[["Josh",14,6,14,14]]},{"text":"Driven from Hebron by Caleb — Jos 15:13,14.","refs":[["Josh",15,13,15,13],["Josh",15,14,15,14]]},{"text":"Driven from Kirjathsepher or Debir by Othniel — Jos 15:15-17; Jdj 1:12,13.","refs":[["Josh",15,15,15,17],["Judg",1,12,1,12],["Judg",1,13,1,13]]},{"text":"Almost annihilated — Jos 11:21,22.","refs":[["Josh",11,21,11,21],["Josh",11,22,11,22]]}],"refCount":22}
